#: warehouse/templates/email/password-reset/body.html:5
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Someone, perhaps you, has made a password reset request for your PyPI "
"account '%(username)s'."
msgstr ""
"Någon, kanske du, har begärt återställning av lösenordet för ditt PyPI-konto"
" ”%(username)s”."

#: warehouse/templates/email/password-reset/body.html:8
#, python-format
msgid ""
"If you wish to proceed with this request, <a href=\"%(href)s\">click to "
"reset your password</a>."
msgstr ""
"Om du vill fortsätta med begäran kan du <a href=\"%(href)s\">klicka för att "
"återställa lösenordet</a>."

#: warehouse/templates/email/password-reset/body.html:11
#: warehouse/templates/email/verify-email/body.html:11
#, python-format
msgid "This link will expire in %(n_hours)s hour."
msgid_plural "This link will expire in %(n_hours)s hours."
msgstr[0] "Länken upphör att gälla om %(n_hours)s timme."
msgstr[1] "Länken upphör att gälla om %(n_hours)s timmar."

#: warehouse/templates/email/password-reset-unverified/body.html:19
#: warehouse/templates/email/password-reset/body.html:15
#: warehouse/templates/email/verify-email/body.html:15
msgid "If you did not make this request, you can safely ignore this email."
msgstr ""
"Om du inte gjorde denna begäran kan du utan risk ignorera e-postmeddelandet."

#: warehouse/templates/email/password-reset-unverified/body.html:5
msgid ""
"Someone, perhaps you, has made a password reset request for a PyPI account "
"associated with this email address."
msgstr ""
"Någon, kanske du, har begärt återställning av lösenordet för ett PyPI-konto "
"som är kopplat till den här e-postadressen."

#: warehouse/templates/email/password-reset-unverified/body.html:8
msgid ""
"However, the email used to make this request is not verified. Your email "
"address must be verified before you can use it to reset your password."
msgstr ""
"E-postadressen som användes för denna begäran är dock inte verifierad. "
"E-postadressen måste vara verifierad innan du kan använda den för att "
"återställa lösenordet."

#: warehouse/templates/email/password-reset-unverified/body.html:11
msgid ""
"If you have another verified email address associated with your PyPI "
"account, try that instead."
msgstr ""
"Om du har en annan verifierad e-postadress kopplad till PyPI-kontot kan du "
"använda den i stället."

#: warehouse/templates/email/password-reset-unverified/body.html:14
#, python-format
msgid ""
"If you cannot use another verified email, follow <a "
"href=\"%(href)s\">account recovery steps</a> for your PyPI account."
msgstr ""
"Om du inte kan använda en annan verifierad e-postadress ska du följa <a "
"href=\"%(href)s\">stegen för kontoåterställning</a> för PyPI-kontot."

#: warehouse/templates/email/password-reset-unverified/body.html:17
#, python-format
msgid "<a href=\"%(href)s\">Read more about verified emails.</a>"
msgstr "<a href=\"%(href)s\">Läs mer om verifierade e-postadresser.</a>"

#: warehouse/templates/email/primary-email-change/body.html:5
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The primary email for your PyPI account <strong>%(username)s</strong> has "
"been changed from <code>%(old_email)s</code> to <code>%(new_email)s</code>"
msgstr ""
"Den primära e-postadressen för ditt PyPI-konto <strong>%(username)s</strong>"
" har ändrats från <code>%(old_email)s</code> till <code>%(new_email)s</code>"

#: warehouse/templates/email/recovery-code-reminder/body.html:5
#, python-format
msgid ""
"We noticed you recently logged into your PyPI account "
"<strong>%(username)s</strong>, which has two-factor authentication enabled, "
"but haven't generated recovery codes for this account."
msgstr ""
"Vi har märkt att du nyligen loggade in på ditt PyPI-konto "
"<strong>%(username)s</strong>, där tvåfaktorsautentisering är aktiverad, men"
" ännu inte har skapat återställningskoder för kontot."

#: warehouse/templates/email/recovery-code-reminder/body.html:12
msgid ""
"If you lose your authentication application or security key(s) and do not "
"have access to these recovery codes, you may permanently lose access to your"
" PyPI account!"
msgstr ""
"Om du förlorar autentiseringsappen eller säkerhetsnyckeln/-nycklarna och "
"saknar åtkomst till återställningskoderna kan du förlora åtkomsten till "
"PyPI-kontot permanent!"

#: warehouse/templates/email/recovery-code-reminder/body.html:19
#, python-format
msgid ""
"You can generate recovery codes for your account here: <a "
"href=\"%(href)s\">%(href)s</a>"
msgstr ""
"Du kan skapa återställningskoder för kontot här: <a "
"href=\"%(href)s\">%(href)s</a>"

#: warehouse/templates/email/recovery-code-used/body.html:5
#, python-format
msgid ""
"A recovery code for your PyPI account <strong>%(username)s</strong> has been"
" used."
msgstr ""
"En återställningskod för ditt PyPI-konto <strong>%(username)s</strong> har "
"använts."

#: warehouse/templates/email/recovery-codes-generated/body.html:5
#, python-format
msgid ""
"New recovery codes for your PyPI account <strong>%(username)s</strong> have "
"been generated."
msgstr ""
"Nya återställningskoder för ditt PyPI-konto <strong>%(username)s</strong> "
"har skapats."

#: warehouse/templates/email/removed-as-organization-member/body.html:5
#, python-format
msgid "You have been removed from the \"%(organization_name)s\" organization"
msgstr "Du har tagits bort från organisationen ”%(organization_name)s”"

#: warehouse/templates/email/removed-as-organization-member/body.html:9
msgid "You are receiving this because you were a member of this organization."
msgstr "Du får detta eftersom du var medlem i organisationen."

#: warehouse/templates/email/removed-as-team-collaborator/body.html:5
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Your team was removed from the %(site)s project %(project)s by "
"%(submitter)s."
msgstr ""
"%(submitter)s har tagit bort ditt team från %(site)s-projektet %(project)s."

#: warehouse/templates/email/removed-as-team-collaborator/body.html:8
#, python-format
msgid ""
"You are receiving this because your team was removed by %(submitter)s from a"
" project on %(site)s."
msgstr ""
"Du får detta eftersom %(submitter)s har tagit bort ditt team från ett "
"projekt på %(site)s."

#: warehouse/templates/email/removed-as-team-member/body.html:5
#, python-format
msgid ""
"You have been removed from the \"%(team_name)s\" team in the "
"\"%(organization_name)s\" organization"
msgstr ""
"Du har tagits bort från teamet ”%(team_name)s” i organisationen "
"”%(organization_name)s”"

#: warehouse/templates/email/removed-as-team-member/body.html:9
msgid "You are receiving this because you were a member of this team."
msgstr "Du får detta eftersom du var medlem i teamet."

#: warehouse/templates/email/role-changed-as-organization-member/body.html:6
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Your role in the \"%(organization_name)s\" organization has been changed to "
"<strong>%(role)s</strong> by %(submitter)s"
msgstr ""
"%(submitter)s har ändrat din roll i organisationen ”%(organization_name)s” "
"till <strong>%(role)s</strong>"
